{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07135","headline":"更被奏留淮南送从弟罢使江东 · 刘长卿","name":"更被奏留淮南送从弟罢使江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又作淮南客，还悲木叶声。\n寒潮落瓜步，秋色上芜城。\n王事何时尽？沧洲羡尔行。\n青山将绿水，惆怅不胜情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}